{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24053","headline":"咏怀 · 白居易","name":"咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我知世无幻，了无干世意。\n世知我无堪，亦无责我事。\n由兹两相忘，因得长自遂。\n自遂意何如，闲官在闲地。\n闲地唯东都，东都少名利。\n闲官是宾客，宾客无牵累。\n嵇康日日嬾，毕卓时时醉。\n酒肆夜深归，僧房日高睡。\n形安不劳苦，神泰无忧畏。\n从官三十年，无如今气味。\n鸿虽脱罗弋，鹤尚居禄位。\n唯此未忘怀，有时犹内媿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}